38368>>>>
38368>>>        Else Begin
38369>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38370>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38371>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38372>>>        End
38372>>>>
38372>>>    End_Procedure
